  * New field network.overlay.wireguard, the WireGuard overlay of a
    replicated appliance (handbook decision 0020, step 2): interface
    (default wg0), address (IPv6, required), ipv4_address, listen_port
    (default 51820), private_key.file and peers (public_key, endpoint,
